{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:25-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.SAVINGS.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["ro"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 folosi\u021bi tasta backspace pentru a \u0219terge."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Tastele s\u0103geat\u0103 st\u00e2nga, sus \u0219i jos sunt dezactivate. La fel \u0219i tastele home, end, pgup \u0219i pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Folosi\u021bi backspace pentru a \u0219terge."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Dac\u0103 valoarea este selectat\u0103, \u00eencepe\u021bi s\u0103 introduce\u021bi o nou\u0103 valoare pentru a \u0219terge valoarea anterioar\u0103."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Atunci c\u00e2nd este selectat un num\u0103r (valoarea este afi\u0219at\u0103 invers), utiliza\u021bi tasta s\u0103geat\u0103 dreapta pentru a \u0219terge selec\u021bia f\u0103r\u0103 a \u0219terge valoarea. Apoi ap\u0103sa\u021bi tasta backspace pentru a edita."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["SUGESTIE: \u00cen general, este mai bine s\u0103 utiliza\u021bi tastele TAB sau SHIFT-TAB pentru a trece de la o intrare la urm\u0103toarea sau la cea anterioar\u0103."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["SFATUL 2: \u00cen general, editarea unei valori este ineficient\u0103. Deoarece valorile sunt selectate automat, tasta\u021bi pur \u0219i simplu num\u0103rul pe care \u00eel dori\u021bi."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Nu introduce\u021bi caracterul de separare a miilor."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Dac\u0103 utiliza\u021bi conven\u021bia SUA, aceasta ar fi virgula.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Sunt suficient de inteligent s\u0103 le introduc pentru dumneavoastr\u0103!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["S-a produs o eroare necunoscut\u0103 de calcul al datei."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 ne furniza\u021bi datele de intrare \u0219i set\u0103rile dvs., astfel \u00eenc\u00e2t s\u0103 putem remedia problema. V\u0103 mul\u021bumim."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Data nu este valabil\u0103 - an gre\u0219it."],"Jan":["ian."],"Feb":["feb."],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Apr"],"May":["Mai"],"Jun":["Iun"],"Jul":["Iul"],"Aug":["Aug"],"Sept":["Sept"],"Oct":["Oct"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["Dec"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Eroare: datele nu se succed."],"Exception":["Excep\u0163ie"],"occurred when accessing":["a ap\u0103rut la accesarea"],"Invalid index":["Indice invalid"],"YTD":["Cumul Anual"],"Running Totals":["Totale cumulative"],"Your Personalized Savings Schedule":["Graficul dvs. personalizat de economii"],"Cash Flow Summary":["Rezumatul fluxului de numerar"],"Total Savings":["Economii totale"],"Number of Investments":["Num\u0103rul de investi\u021bii"],"Return on Investment (ROI)":["Rentabilitatea investi\u021biei (ROI)"],"Total Gain":["C\u00e2\u0219tig total"],"Last Cash Flow Date":["Data ultimului flux de numerar"],"Years":["Ani"],"Savings Schedule":["Grafic de economii"],"Year":["Anul"],"Date":["Data"],"Deposit":["Depozit"],"Interest":["Dob\u00e2nd\u0103"],"Net Change":["Varia\u021bie net\u0103"],"Balance":["Sold"],"Annual Savings":["Economii anuale"],"Annual Interest":["Dob\u00e2nd\u0103 anual\u0103"],"Change in Balance":["Modificarea soldului"],"Annual Savings and Interest Totals":["Total economii anuale \u0219i dob\u00e2nzi"],"Accumulated Savings and Interest":["Economii \u0219i dob\u00e2nzi acumulate"],"Amount Saved & Interest as Percentage of Total Value":["Suma economisit\u0103 \u0219i dob\u00e2nda ca procent din valoarea total\u0103"],"Running Investment":["Investi\u021bie cumulat\u0103"],"Running Savings":["Economii acumulate"],"Running Interest":["Dob\u00e2nd\u0103 cumulat\u0103"],"Total Deposits":["Total depozite"],"Total Interest Earned":["Dob\u00e2nda total\u0103 c\u00e2\u0219tigat\u0103"],"Total Value":["Valoarea total\u0103"],"Pct. of Total":["Pct. din total"],"Number of Deposits":["Num\u0103rul de depozite"],"Interest Rate":["Rata dob\u00e2nzii"],"Total Interest":["Dob\u00e2nda total\u0103"],"\"Net Change\" is change from prior period i.e. prior balance plus deposit, plus interest less withdrawal.":["\"Varia\u021bia net\u0103\" reprezint\u0103 varia\u021bia fa\u021b\u0103 de perioada anterioar\u0103, adic\u0103 soldul anterior plus depozitul, plus dob\u00e2nda, mai pu\u021bin retragerea."],"Annual Deposit and Interest Totals":["Totaluri anuale ale depozitelor \u0219i dob\u00e2nzilor"],"Accumulated Deposit and Interest":["Depozit \u0219i dob\u00e2nd\u0103 acumulate"],"Annual Deposit":["Depozit anual"],"Running Deposit":["Depozit acumulat"],"Savings Calculator \u2014 calculate future value":["Calculator de economii - calcula\u021bi valoarea viitoare"],"<p>This calculator easily answers the question \"If I save \"X\" amount for \"Y\" months what will the value be at the end?\"<\/p>":["<p>Acest calculator r\u0103spunde cu u\u0219urin\u021b\u0103 la \u00eentrebarea \"Dac\u0103 economisesc suma de \"X\" pentru \"Y\" luni, care va fi valoarea la final?\"<\/p>"],"<p>The user enters the \"Periodic Savings Amount\" (amount saved or invested every month); the \"Number of Months\" and the \"Annual Interest Rate\" or the annual rate of return one expects to earn on their investments.<\/p>":["<p>Utilizatorul introduce \"Suma Periodic\u0103 de Economii\" (suma economisit\u0103 sau investit\u0103 \u00een fiecare lun\u0103); \"Num\u0103rul de Luni\" \u0219i \"Rata Dob\u00e2nzii Anuale\" sau rata anual\u0103 a rentabilit\u0103\u021bii a\u0219teptate de la investi\u021bii.<\/p>"],"<p>The calculator quickly creates a savings schedule and a set of charts that will help the user see the relationship between the amount invested and the return on the investment.<\/p>":["<p>Calculatorul creeaz\u0103 rapid un program de economii \u0219i un set de grafice care vor ajuta utilizatorul s\u0103 vad\u0103 rela\u021bia dintre suma investit\u0103 \u0219i rentabilitatea investi\u021biei.<\/p>"],"<p>The investment term is always expressed in months.<\/p>":["<p>Perioada investi\u021biei este \u00eentotdeauna exprimat\u0103 \u00een luni.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 luni = &nbsp;5 ani<\/li><li>120 luni = 10 ani<\/li><li>180 luni = 15 ani<\/li><li>240 luni = 20 ani<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 luni = 30 ani<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Savings Calculator\" - one that lets the user solve for the starting amount, the amount to invest, the interest rate, the term required to reach a goal or the future value; or if you would like to easily print the schedule; or if you need to pick a different investment frequency, then you may want to try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Dac\u0103 ave\u021bi nevoie de un \"calculator de economii\" mai avansat - unul care permite utilizatorului s\u0103 calculeze suma ini\u021bial\u0103, suma de investit, rata dob\u00e2nzii, perioada necesar\u0103 pentru a atinge un obiectiv sau valoarea viitoare; sau dac\u0103 dori\u021bi s\u0103 imprima\u021bi cu u\u0219urin\u021b\u0103 programul; sau dac\u0103 trebuie s\u0103 alege\u021bi o frecven\u021b\u0103 de investi\u021bie diferit\u0103, pute\u021bi \u00eencerca calculatorul disponibil aici: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Savings Calculator\" - one that lets the user solve for the starting amount, the amount to invest, the interest rate, the term required to reach a goal or the future value; or if you need to pick a different investment frequency, then you may want to try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Dac\u0103 ave\u021bi nevoie de un \"calculator de economii\" mai avansat - unul care permite utilizatorului s\u0103 calculeze suma ini\u021bial\u0103, suma de investit, rata dob\u00e2nzii, perioada necesar\u0103 pentru a atinge un obiectiv sau valoarea viitoare; sau dac\u0103 trebuie s\u0103 alege\u021bi o frecven\u021b\u0103 de investi\u021bie diferit\u0103, pute\u021bi \u00eencerca calculatorul disponibil aici: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Preg\u0103tit pentru"],"Address":["Adres\u0103"],"City, State  ZIP":["Ora\u0219, Jude\u021b, Cod po\u0219tal"],"Prepared On":["Preg\u0103tit la"],"Prepared by":["Preg\u0103tit de"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Site web"],"Unknown":["Necunoscut"],"u":["n"],"U":["N"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datele trebuie s\u0103 fie prima zi a lunii."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Un obiect de dat\u0103 JavaScript nevalid."],"Monthly":["Lunar"]}}}